1. Do not modify backend unless explicitly instructed.
2. Do not invent API contracts.
3. Do not hardcode infrastructure URLs throughout the UI.
4. Do not sacrifice functionality for visual design.
5. Do not sacrifice visual quality for implementation convenience.
6. Do not remove voice functionality.
7. Do not remove the documented voice architecture.
8. Do not scatter voice logic across components.
9. Do not create fake functionality.
10. Do not expose admin controls to normal users.
